  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NAM NID Election project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">NAM NID Valprojekt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att st&#xe4;rka det namibiska valsystemet genom att sammast&#xe4;lla en rapport som adresserar bristerna i nuvarande system och att utveckla teknisk expertis p&#xe5; val&#xf6;vervakningsomr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at strengthening the Namibian electoral system through compiling a report that addresses deficiences in the electoral system, and to develop technical expertise in election observation/monitoring and election related advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
